  "$comment": "Static PII denylist for event payloads (PAP-555). Superseded by the pii annotation registry of PAP-559, which derives this list from Drizzle column annotations. Keys are normalised before matching: lower-cased with '_', '-' and spaces removed. deniedKeys match the whole key; deniedSuffixes match the end of a key, so 'billingEmail' is denied by the 'email' suffix while 'jobName' is not denied by the 'name' key.",
  "version": 1,
  "issue": "PAP-555",
  "supersededBy": "PAP-559",
  "policy": "Event payloads carry ids and changed fields only, never whole rows, names, contact details, credentials or free text (Interface & Data Contracts section 3, PAP-40 policy).",
